cat <<NEXT

------------------------------------------------------------
 btms_simulation is ready (compact edition).
------------------------------------------------------------
Next steps:

  cd "$T"
  python3 -m venv .venv && source .venv/bin/activate
  pip install -r requirements.txt

  python -m pytest tests/ -v      # verification suite (37 tests, ~2.5 min)
  python -m btms_sim              # production study -> results/ (~5 min)

  results/ will then contain the 4-case comparison (bare / PW /
  PW+5%EG / PW+ZnO+h-BN): figures 1-5 (PNG), time-series CSVs,
